.................... ////  vectors as well as reserving space for the bootloader.           ////
.................... ////                                                                   ////
.................... ////  LOADER_END may need to be adjusted for a specific chip and       ////
.................... ////  bootloader.  LOADER_END must be 1 minus a multiple of            ////
